{"track":"ds","category":"딥러닝","level":1,"title":"하이퍼볼릭 탄젠트","desc":"<p>활성화 함수 <b>tanh</b>(−1 ~ 1 사이 값)를 소수 넷째 자리까지 반올림해 돌려주는 <code>tanh_value(x)</code>를 만드세요. (<code>math.tanh</code> 또는 <code>np.tanh</code>)</p>","starter":"def tanh_value(x):\n    pass\n","solution":"import math\n\n\ndef tanh_value(x):\n    return round(math.tanh(x), 4)\n","hint":"<p><code>math.tanh(x)</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"tanh_value(0)","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"tanh_value(1)","expected":0.7616,"visible":true},{"call":"tanh_value(-1)","expected":-0.7616,"visible":false},{"call":"tanh_value(2)","expected":0.964,"visible":false}],"id":"ds-456"}